# Force LF line endings for deploy scripts in this directory.
# Prevents CRLF→LF sed-strip from showing as a local modification
# when the repo is cloned on Windows and then used from WSL2.
# (runner-scheduler.py shipped CRLF and broke its systemd unit with
#  `/usr/bin/env: 'python3\r'` exit 127 — *.py must be LF too.)
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
